(
F4 T5 / C35 (2026-10-10): post-solve material state pass. Two bar2 in
series, von Mises yield 0.01 (element 1) and 1 (element 2), node 3
pulled with velx 1, ONE step of dt 0.05 with ONE equilibrium iteration.
The reported strain, plastic strain and stress are those of the solved
velocity (= Professional 02-08-2026: node 1 eptxx 0.025, eppxx
0.0100001, sigxx 0.0149999; node 2 eppxx 0.00500006, sigxx 0.0199999;
node 3 eptxx = sigxx 0.025; the Professional's plastic return has a
1.25e-7 tolerance, hence 1e-6). Old GNU (pre-solve iterate): eptxx
0 / 0.025 / 0.05, eppxx 0 (no yielding), sigxx 0 / 0.025 / 0.05.
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_strain_total
materi_strain_plasti
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0
node 2 1
node 3 2
element 1 -bar2 1 2
element 2 -bar2 2 3
element_group 1 1
element_group 2 2
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx
bounda_time 0 0.
bounda_dof 1 3 -velx
bounda_time 1 1.
group_type 1 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 1 1.
group_materi_plasti_vonmises 1 0.01
group_type 2 -materi
group_materi_elasti_young 2 1.
group_materi_plasti_vonmises 2 1.
control_timestep 0 0.05 0.05
control_timestep_iterations 0 1
target_item 0 -node_dof 1 -eptxx
target_value 0 0.025 1.e-6
target_item 1 -node_dof 1 -eppxx
target_value 1 0.01 1.e-6
target_item 2 -node_dof 1 -sigxx
target_value 2 0.015 1.e-6
target_item 3 -node_dof 2 -eppxx
target_value 3 0.005 1.e-6
target_item 4 -node_dof 2 -sigxx
target_value 4 0.02 1.e-6
target_item 5 -node_dof 3 -eptxx
target_value 5 0.025 1.e-6
target_item 6 -node_dof 3 -sigxx
target_value 6 0.025 1.e-6
target_item 7 -node_dof 2 -disx
target_value 7 0.025 1.e-6
end_data
